--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -1,3 +1,8 @@
 # notify
 
 Sends users a digest of their unread notifications.
+
+## Running
+
+The digest job runs after the nightly notification cleanup, so a digest never includes
+notifications that the cleanup removed.
--- a/docs/oncall.md
+++ b/docs/oncall.md
@@ -2,3 +2,8 @@
 
 The rota is in the team calendar. Page the secondary if the primary has not answered
 within 15 minutes.
+
+## Mail-provider incidents
+
+During a mail-provider incident, support pauses all sending from the provider's
+dashboard. Ask in #mail-ops before pausing.
